Two sessions of the pi coding agent (https://pi.dev) by Armin Ronacher,
stripped of all personal data with scripts/scrub-pi-session.mjs:

openai.jsonl     an OpenAI Codex session (19 MiB, 2,823 entries, 23 images)
anthropic.jsonl  an Anthropic session (25 MiB, 1,028 entries, 29 images)

All text is replaced by random words of the same length and case, ids by
random ids, the images by generated PNGs of about the same size and the
timestamps are shifted.  The structure, the keys, the numbers, the escapes
and the names of the providers, models and tools are those of the sessions.
